SUMMARY:Cultural ARTS Series - Manhattan String Quartet - NEWER VOICES
DESCRIPTION:May 16\, 7:30 PM \nProgram: \nNEWER VOICES \nJoaquin Turina: La Oraci6n del Torero\, op. 34 • \nSamuel Barber: String Quartet in B Minor\, op. 11 – II. Molto adagio• \nGrieg: String Quartet in G Minor\, op. 2 \n  \nTickets are required. Wine and cheese refreshments are included with the ticket.
URL:https://montclairfoundation.org/event/cultural-arts-series-manhattan-string-quartet-2/
