SUMMARY:Garden to Table - Fruit & Veggie Critters
DESCRIPTION:Garden to Table \nMondays\, 4:00 PM – 5:00 PM \nMay 18 – Fruit & Veggie Critters \nWe will be preparing some adorable and delicious Fruit & Veggie Critters\, and learn about the insects living in our gardens.   \nEnjoy quality time in the garden with your child/children as we explore the Edible Garden and all that it has to offer. Help us weed and water\, plant\, and harvest. We will prepare a simple snack with ingredients inspired by the garden. Appropriate for children ages 4 and up but all are welcome. Children must be accompanied by an adult. \nSponsored by  \nFee: $15/class per child for Members / $20/class per child for General Public \nRegistration required by 1 day prior to each class
URL:https://montclairfoundation.org/event/garden-to-table-fruit-veggie-critters/
LOCATION:Van Vleck House & Gardens\, 21 Van Vleck Street\, Montclair\, 07042\, United States
CATEGORIES:Classes,Children
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://montclairfoundation.org/content/uploads/2025/07/unnamed-5.png
END:VEVENT
