X-SOURCE:Montclair Foundation
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260606T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260606T120000
DTSTAMP:20260514T000338
CREATED:20251211T204646Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260116T213137Z
UID:10005975-1780740000-1780747200@montclairfoundation.org
SUMMARY:Outdoor Adventures: Insect Safari
DESCRIPTION:June 6th – Insect Safari  \nSaturday\, 10:00 AM – 12:00 PM \nYou can find many different insects buzzing\, wiggling\, and crawling around the gardens. Join us for an Insect Safari at this month’s Outdoor Adventures. Create a bug inspired craft\, take a hike looking for insects\, and learn about the important roles insects play in the garden.  \nOn our Outdoor Adventures\, you and your family explore and learn about the outdoor world through crafts\, scavenger hunts\, activity sheets and educational displays. Each program will focus on a specific theme\, and our Van Vleck Education team will guide your family through this interactive learning experience. This program is entirely outdoors\, weather dependent. Registration is required and includes everything you need to participate in the program. Designed for children ages 4 -11 but all are welcome. \nFee: FREE for Members of Van Vleck; $15 per family  for  General Public \nRegistration required by 1 day prior to each class \n \nSponsored by  \n 
URL:https://montclairfoundation.org/event/outdoor-adventures-insect-safari-2/
LOCATION:Van Vleck House & Gardens\, 21 Van Vleck Street\, Montclair\, 07042\, United States
CATEGORIES:Classes,Children,Family
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://montclairfoundation.org/content/uploads/2022/04/bug.jpg
END:VEVENT
