DESCRIPTION:Shannon McNally performs on Sunday\, June 7th\, 4:00PM on the wisteria terrace behind Van Vleck House. Seating is on your own blanket or lawn chair on the formal garden lawn* facing Van Vleck House. Tickets are required.\nPresented by Outpost in the Burbs. Tickets on sale Friday\, February 12th – Family pack available\nhttps://outpostintheburbs.thundertix.com/events/259784\n\n\n*No pets\, alcohol\, glass or tents permitted.
