SUMMARY:Garden to Table - Herb Butter
DESCRIPTION:Garden to Table \nMondays\, 4:00 PM – 5:00 PM \nJune 8 – Herb Butter \nJoin us for the last Garden to Table class of the spring season\, as we prepare some yummy herb butter. Learn how butter is made\, be creative adding in a herbs mixture of your choice\, and plant your mini herb garden to take home.  \nEnjoy quality time in the garden with your child/children as we explore the Edible Garden and all that it has to offer. Help us weed and water\, plant\, and harvest. We will prepare a simple snack with ingredients inspired by the garden. Appropriate for children ages 4 and up but all are welcome. Children must be accompanied by an adult. \nSponsored by  \nFee: $15/class per child for Members / $20/class per child for General Public \nRegistration required by 1 day prior to each class
